{"version":1,"content":"<p>法國東南部自周一（19日）起暴雨，部分城市遭水淹。</p><p>法新社片段可見，位於馬賽西北部的Saint-Mitre-les-Remparts，民房及汽車被水浸。</p><p>Saint-Mitre-les-Remparts已有1人喪生，當地居民形容情況如「人間煉獄」，「一切都被顛倒，所有家具翻倒」。</p><p>（法新社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T11:40:37.747015+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T06:28:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T23:37:47.215766+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:37:40.197903+00:00","content_hash":"2006abdd9bfbae226e81718e0eb462ddb0f464b473feabbc16353cc118f9c60c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}